    """Bound the serialized Lean wire AST, not its top-level dict key count.

    Lean export evidence consists of JSON-compatible nested dictionaries/lists,
    sometimes tens of megabytes for a tiny textual proof. The Kernel has already
    independently checked this evidence; its canonical SHA-256 is preserved by
    the certificate. This controls only history/UI/API payload size.
